2. Compute 24-month baseline & anomaly multiples: Using the CSV, for each (region × product_line) compute the 24-month rolling mean of monthly sales volume; then for every month compute the ratio = that month's volume / 24-month mean. Save the full result table to a CSV file (e.g. offline_data/anomaly_multiples.csv) with columns: region, product_line, month, monthly_volume, mean_24m, multiple, return_rate → code_agent
